# What's my local AI?

Detect your hardware right in your browser and find out which local models you can run locally with Ollama or LM Studio.
Nothing is uploaded.

## Pages

- [Home]({{ site.url }}/): Check the best model you can run on your own machine in the browser, with nothing uploaded -
[Credits]({{ site.url }}/credits/): Technologies and libraries used to build the What's my local AI website

## Documentation

- [LM Studio](https://lmstudio.ai): Local model runner supported by the tool and offered as a runner choice in the
interface - [Ollama](https://ollama.com): Local model runner supported by the tool and offered as a runner choice in the
interface

## Source

- [GitHub - clubmatto/vetrina](https://github.com/clubmatto/vetrina): Open source monorepo containing the source of this
site - [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co): Model repository used to source local models and weights for the tool
